{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850794678463102977","content":"That Bitch Logan — Today at 11:48 AM\nHey radar! I have a question about houses. So I know that most people are living in air ships, but that’s not what I had envisioned for Adon. In my head they live in a spare bedroom (converted into a studio apartment) located above a restaurant\n[11:48 AM]\nIs there any way that would be possible?\n\nradar — Today at 11:50 AM\nSadly no, we aren't giving out houses this year. Your home is meant to be vulnerable and there is meant to be risk associated with. And if I give out one, a million others will ask for the same thing.","created_at":"2021-07-10T18:51:10.122000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T18:51:24.229000Z","id":"863492563784040539","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
